    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Master the Highways: Multiplayer Mayhem</u></strong><u></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In LANESPLIT'S multiplayer game mode, your goal is to rack up as many points as possible. Points are earned based on your speed and how skillfully you navigate traffic. The faster you ride, the higher your score multiplier, with the biggest rewards coming from close, skillful lane splitting. Crashes or driving too slowly will reset your current points to zero with your highest points being saved to the global leaderboards.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278310/extras/d94ee05bc289d81317780c0a8fbeb43f.poster.avif?t=1751399386\" width=518 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278310/extras/d94ee05bc289d81317780c0a8fbeb43f.webm?t=1751399386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Endless Thrills</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a variety of high-performance motorcycles, each with unique stats tailored for different playstyles\u2014whether you prefer raw speed, agile handling, or a balance of both. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278310/extras/6c87d851676a1de0c4178b709890d678.poster.avif?t=1751399386\" width=518 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278310/extras/6c87d851676a1de0c4178b709890d678.webm?t=1751399386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Realistic Handling, Exhilarating Speed</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience ultra-realistic motorcycle physics with precision handling and smooth controls. Whether weaving through traffic or gunning for the fastest time, the challenge is yours to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278310/extras/2a9568f8870faf4669160a39722b09a6.poster.avif?t=1751399386\" width=518 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278310/extras/2a9568f8870faf4669160a39722b09a6.webm?t=1751399386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Master the Highways: Multiplayer Mayhem</u></strong><u></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In LANESPLIT'S multiplayer game mode, your goal is to rack up as many points as possible. Points are earned based on your speed and how skillfully you navigate traffic. The faster you ride, the higher your score multiplier, with the biggest rewards coming from close, skillful lane splitting. Crashes or driving too slowly will reset your current points to zero with your highest points being saved to the global leaderboards.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278310/extras/d94ee05bc289d81317780c0a8fbeb43f.poster.avif?t=1751399386\" width=518 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278310/extras/d94ee05bc289d81317780c0a8fbeb43f.webm?t=1751399386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Endless Thrills</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a variety of high-performance motorcycles, each with unique stats tailored for different playstyles\u2014whether you prefer raw speed, agile handling, or a balance of both. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278310/extras/6c87d851676a1de0c4178b709890d678.poster.avif?t=1751399386\" width=518 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278310/extras/6c87d851676a1de0c4178b709890d678.webm?t=1751399386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Realistic Handling, Exhilarating Speed</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience ultra-realistic motorcycle physics with precision handling and smooth controls. Whether weaving through traffic or gunning for the fastest time, the challenge is yours to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278310/extras/2a9568f8870faf4669160a39722b09a6.poster.avif?t=1751399386\" width=518 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278310/extras/2a9568f8870faf4669160a39722b09a6.webm?t=1751399386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
